    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08028374fa2ed49d53401c8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在未来，究竟有什么事情在等着我们呢？\r\n——我仍不得而知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d533e3936d7fc6107d708db04455c145b584d59638b0fc3b5f0e82ab3766f78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b40d5c4a3e88c18d009fb9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她的用语还是那么奇妙，\r\n要理解她想表达的意思更是难上加难。不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "570395234ad417472e668127fa6014219ca7767ae932d26d2f55f345c9e8192b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105100.json",
      "json_path": [
