      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话语所立起的壁垒，\r\n迄今为止已令她无端地经历了许多悲剧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef7b83153497826a180c8afa517147383b57b298e0c4030ff93d294fd3d837f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
